  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The energy released per fission of nucleus of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>240</mn></mmultiscripts></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math>. The energy released if all the atoms in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of pure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>240</mn></mmultiscripts></math> undergo fission is _____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>25</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math>. &nbsp;</p><p>(Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup></math>) &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Energy released per fission is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math>.</p><p>The number of atoms <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>120</mn><mn>240</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>atoms</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Total energy released,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>25</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math></p>"
  }
